# DeMaxtore Turkey Importer — Master Product Scope v1.0

**Document status:** Authoritative Product Specification  
**Product:** DeMaxtore Turkey Importer / Import Operating System  
**Target market:** Companies doing imports into Turkey  
**Core model:** Freight + Customs + Import Operating System  
**Architecture principle:** Shared logistics engine, separate Turkey Importer customer experience

---

## Product Purpose

> One Import. One Journey. One Operational Record.

The Turkey Importer connects a full import transaction:

**PO / Product context → Freight → Booking → Shipment → Container Visibility → Customs → Inland Delivery → POD → Landed Cost**

The customer must not be forced to reconcile operational data from separate systems themselves.

